{"seq":5,"slug":"civil-engineering","title":"土木工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"土木工程-简介\">土木工程 简介</h1><p>土木工程把自然环境改造为人类宜居、可通行的空间——桥梁、隧道、高楼、公路、地基、水坝。它的独特约束是：每一个结构都要在真实的地质条件和气候环境中、以可接受的造价、安全服役数十年乃至上百年。本学习空间面向大学本科水平，目标是建立&quot;受力分析 → 构件设计 → 地基适配 → 落地施工 → 系统运行&quot;这条贯穿全专业的主线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>土木工程与同属工程门类的若干 hub 在内容上相邻但定位不同。下面这张表帮你判断&quot;某个问题该来这里，还是去隔壁&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>本 hub（土木工程）关注</th>\n<th>应去的兄弟 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>力学基础</td>\n<td>结构内力、土体应力、整体安全性</td>\n<td><a href=\"../mechanical-engineering/mechanics-of-materials/stress-strain\">机械工程·材料力学</a>：构件级应力应变、疲劳断裂的一般原理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>材料</td>\n<td>选材后的结构受力与构造</td>\n<td><a href=\"../materials-science/metallic-materials/steel-alloys\">材料科学</a>：钢/混凝土/复合材料的微观组织与性能成因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>房屋</td>\n<td>结构体系、基础、施工管理</td>\n<td><a href=\"../architecture/design-principles/space-and-function\">建筑学</a>：空间、功能、形式、城市与可持续设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境</td>\n<td>工程的合规与防灾边界</td>\n<td><a href=\"../environmental-engineering/water-pollution-control/water-quality-fundamentals\">环境工程</a>：水/气/固污染治理与环境系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制</td>\n<td>交通信号的工程应用</td>\n<td><a href=\"../electrical-engineering/control-systems/classical-control\">电气工程·控制系统</a>：反馈控制的数学理论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话边界：<strong>本 hub 回答&quot;如何让一个建成物安全、经济地立住并运行起来&quot;；力学/材料/控制的底层原理在对应工程 hub，建筑空间与城市形态在建筑学 hub。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"章节结构\">章节结构</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 结构工程</strong>：结构分析 → 钢筋混凝土 → 钢结构，从求内力到给两大主流材料体系做设计。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 岩土工程</strong>：土力学 → 基础设计 → 边坡稳定，处理土这种散粒体地基与天然/人工边坡。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 施工管理</strong>：进度 → 造价 → 质量与安全，关注工程如何按期、控费、安全地落地。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章 交通工程</strong>：公路几何设计 → 交通工程学 → 城市轨道交通，研究人与货物流动的基础设施。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>本科生按部就班</strong>：严格按 1→2→3→4 章顺序。第一章的结构分析是整个专业的&quot;语法&quot;，必须先掌握；第二章的土力学是地基与边坡的共同基础；第三、四章可在前两章之后任选先后。</li>\n<li><strong>备考/速成（注册工程师方向）</strong>：先 1.1 结构分析、2.1 土力学打底，再直奔与目标考试对应的章节（结构方向重 1.2/1.3，岩土方向重 2.2/2.3）。</li>\n<li><strong>跨专业了解（建筑/规划/管理背景）</strong>：可跳过繁重公式推导，按 1.1（概念）→ 3 章（管理全过程）→ 4 章（交通）阅读，重点看每节&quot;知识要点&quot;与&quot;小结&quot;，再循各节末&quot;延伸阅读与跨学科链接&quot;按需深入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>学习本 hub 前，建议具备：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>高等数学</strong>：微积分、常微分方程、线性代数（矩阵位移法、固结方程都会用到）。</li>\n<li><strong>理论力学与静力学</strong>：力系平衡、自由体受力图——这是第一章结构分析的直接前提。</li>\n<li><strong>材料力学基础</strong>：应力应变、梁的弯曲与扭转。若不足，可先读 <a href=\"../mechanical-engineering/mechanics-of-materials/beam-bending\">机械工程·材料力学</a> 补齐。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>学习时多观察身边的工地与基础设施，思考其结构形式与施工顺序为何如此选择——这种&quot;把理论投射到实物&quot;的习惯会让本专业的学习事半功倍。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structural-engineering","title":"结构工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/structural-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structural-analysis","title":"大学土木工程 — 结构分析基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/structural-engineering/structural-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reinforced-concrete","title":"大学土木工程 — 钢筋混凝土结构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/structural-engineering/reinforced-concrete"},{"seq":3,"slug":"steel-structures","title":"大学土木工程 — 钢结构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/structural-engineering/steel-structures"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"geotechnical-engineering","title":"岩土工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/geotechnical-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"soil-mechanics","title":"大学土木工程 — 土力学基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/geotechnical-engineering/soil-mechanics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"foundation-design","title":"大学土木工程 — 基础工程设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/geotechnical-engineering/foundation-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"slope-stability","title":"大学土木工程 — 边坡稳定性分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/geotechnical-engineering/slope-stability"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"construction-management","title":"施工管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/construction-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"project-scheduling","title":"大学土木工程 — 工程项目进度管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/construction-management/project-scheduling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-estimation","title":"大学土木工程 — 工程造价与费用估算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/construction-management/cost-estimation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-safety","title":"大学土木工程 — 工程质量与安全管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/construction-management/quality-safety"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"transportation-engineering","title":"交通工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/transportation-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"highway-design","title":"大学土木工程 — 公路几何设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/transportation-engineering/highway-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"traffic-engineering","title":"大学土木工程 — 交通工程学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/transportation-engineering/traffic-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"urban-transit","title":"大学土木工程 — 城市轨道交通工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/civil-engineering/transportation-engineering/urban-transit"}]}]}